摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Built with the dsh-bot plugin, this is an immersive 2.5D office game where you interact and collaborate with your agent employees.基于dsh-bot插件制作，沉浸式2.5D办公室游戏，与你的agent员工交互协作","id":"gh:1425658942","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"DeepSeek-Office","slug":"wyx135230/DeepSeek-Office","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","game","muti-agent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Built with the dsh-bot plugin, this is an immersive 2.5D office game where you interact and collabor"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ate with your agent employees.基于dsh-bot插件制作，沉浸式2.5D办公室游戏，与你的agent员工交互协作"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DeepSeek Office\nA place to work, meet and take a break with your AI team.\nA modern 2.5D office simul"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"ation for DeepSeek Harness, built on persistent AI teammates and real group conversations.\nEnglish ·"},{"id":"p2s3","text":" 简体中文\nv0.7.1 · Three.js + Phaser · Apache-2.0 code\nHighlights · Screenshots · Quick start · How to p"},{"id":"p2s4","text":"· Three.js + Phaser · Apache-2.0 code\nHighlights · Screenshots · Quick start · How to play · Roadmap"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Actual gameplay from an isolated local test team. Office models and textures are bundled with the pl"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"l gameplay from an isolated local test team. Office models and textures are bundled with the plugin."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Create a team, give everyone a role, and walk into its office. Each group chat becomes a floor: cowo"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rkers have desks, gather for meetings, share sofas and head off for a coffee. Their work and convers"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ations run through the existing Harness agent system."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DeepSeek Office builds on DS Bot and uses the public plugin interfaces of DeepSeek Harness. Long-liv"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ed identities, memory, group collaboration, model settings and permissions remain part of the same t"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"dentities, memory, group collaboration, model settings and permissions remain part of the same team."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What's new in 0.7.1"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Updates on newer DSH**: fix `already-installed` by replacing the plugin through DSH's public plu"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"gin-manager APIs, preserving its enabled selection and retaining the restart path for older profiles"},{"id":"p7s3","text":".\n- **Version checks and recovery**: verify the installed version and attempt to restore the previou"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"s release if replacement fails. Existing 0.6.1 and 0.7.0 installations need one manual package repla"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"cement; see the update instructions below.\n- **Compatibility**: verified with DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 and 0.2"},{"id":"p7s6","text":".1-rc.2. UI styles, office scenes, game interactions and multi-agent behavior are unchanged."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What's new in 0.7.0"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Warmer rooms**: work studios gain desk pads, stationery, lamps or headphones, cable trays, corkb"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"oards and rugs; coffee studios gain cup shelves, bean jars and botanical prints; screening rooms gai"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"n acoustic panels, fabric details, wall lights and cabinet vents. These are visual additions within "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"the existing layout, with the existing interface and interaction rules preserved.\n- **A phone in the"},{"id":"p9s5","text":" scene**: open private and group chats from anywhere, or read web pages in the phone's Browser app. "},{"id":"p9s6","text":"The phone uses the existing Sessions and native composer.\n- **Clearer conversations and navigation**"},{"id":"p9s7","text":": face-to-face dialogue has illustrated portraits and message-history controls. The upper-right HUD "},{"id":"p9s8","text":"brings together the map, camera controls, floors, team and options; nearby prompts and compact activ"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"ity cards support keyboard interaction.\n- **Updated characters**: the supplied long-haired character"},{"id":"p9s10","text":" model is rigged for the existing idle, walk, sit, drink and exercise animations, with independent a"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"for the existing idle, walk, sit, drink and exercise animations, with independent appearance colors."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## What makes it interesting"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Experience | What you can do |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **One group, one floor** | Give different teams their own offices. Each floor keeps its seeded roo"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"m placement and grows work rooms as members join. |\n| **Meetings inside the scene** | Take the head "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"seat, watch coworkers enter in order, and send messages to the real group from the meeting composer."},{"id":"p12s4","text":" |\n| **A team you can recognize** | Coworkers have individual skin, hair, upper garment, lower garme"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"nt and shoe colors, with walking and seated animations. |\n| **Small breaks between tasks** | Brew co"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"ffee, turn pages, catch stars at the arcade, prepare lunch, mix a mocktail or follow a stretch rhyth"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"m. |\n| **A shared screening room** | Six three-person sofas face a large curved TV. People can use s"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"eparate seats on the same sofa. |\n| **An office with a sense of time** | Local time shapes sunlight "},{"id":"p12s9","text":"and evening lighting. Plants, gardens and the surrounding city complete the setting. |\n| **Chats and"},{"id":"p12s10","text":" a browser in your pocket** | Use **Phone** or `P` to open private chats, groups and a mobile-style "},{"id":"p12s11","text":"web reader without walking back to a desk. |\n| **Your existing AI tools** | Keep private chats, grou"},{"id":"p12s12","text":"p messages, memory, capabilities, scheduled tasks and usage statistics. Real work takes priority ove"},{"id":"p12s13","text":"r leisure animations. |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The meeting-room wall display opens the group's complete conversation, including history and live re"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"plies. Short speech bubbles show recent messages above the speaker; the chat panel keeps the full te"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" bubbles show recent messages above the speaker; the chat panel keeps the full text and attachments."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## A look inside"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Meet around the same table"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Your head seat, eight member chairs and orderly standing places for the rest of the team."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Keep the whole conversation in view"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The wall display and meeting pane reuse the same group chat, history and message input."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Visit another team's floor"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Step into the lift, pick a destination, and travel through a door-and-fade transition."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Save a seat for a break"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Three evenly spaced sofa rows provide 18 seats. The TV currently shows a static cinema illustration."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Screenshots record working development builds; room arrangements vary by group. Click an image for t"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ecord working development builds; room arrangements vary by group. Click an image for the full view."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 1. Prepare Harness"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Install DeepSeek Harness. The development harness is pinned to **`0.2.0-rc.2`**; current office ch"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ecks use an isolated Web profile on Windows.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## What's next"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"These are development plans, not features included in the current release."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- [ ] **Cross-device multiplayer** — shared rooms, presence, player movement and appearance synchron"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ization, reconnection and session permissions, so people on different computers can enter the same o"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ffice.\n- [ ] **Richer environments** — extend the current work/coffee/screening-room decoration pass"},{"id":"p29s4","text":" to other facilities, gardens and architecture; expand character shapes, outfits and animation quali"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"ty.\n- [ ] **More expressive interactions** — refine approaching, turning, sitting and standing; add "},{"id":"p29s6","text":"richer facility behavior, meeting feedback and video controls for the screening room.\n- [ ] **User-d"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"esigned spaces** — let users place furniture, adjust room layouts, choose styles and save reusable f"},{"id":"p29s8","text":"loor templates, then explore AI-assisted scene design."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
